{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/TransfusionVideo_3.gif?t=1736787618\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a prisoner far from home, you must earn your freedom in the Arena slaying lizard-like creatures called Lacerites. Utilize the gifts of bloodthirsty gods to gain the edge in combat as you tear through wave after wave to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/TransfusionVideo_5.gif?t=1736787618\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SLASH, STAB, AND SEVER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Butcher hordes of Lacerites in gladiatorial combat with a variety of weapons from ancient Roman and Aztec cultures. Weaken enemies with your weapons to <i>break</i> them both in body and spirit. Dismember opponents limb by limb until you\u2019re the last one standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/TransfusionVideo_1.gif?t=1736787618\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BUILD YOUR ARSENAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock a variety of weapons to smear Lacerites onto the arena floor. Sprout a tree from a spear, bash a skull with a super-sized macuahuitl, and wield the abilities of the gods with unique weapons specialized to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2397910/extras/DiscordSteamHeader.png?t=1736787618\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">JOIN THE RIDE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transfusion is an early access title and a passion project for our small dev team. If you enjoy our game, and want to help determine its future, please join our discord, help grow our community, and 